  "id": 39,
  "Specification": "Age_Channel: A TLA+ model of an age-tracking message channel. Messages in transit carry a content field and an age counter incremented each step. Pickup adds messages with age 0; Deliver moves a subset addressed to a receiver into inDelivery; AttainAge increments the age of all in-transit messages. TypeOK constrains inTransit to Boxes and inDelivery to Messages.",
